<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav March retail sales rise 16 pct vs Feb.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav March retail sales rise 16 pct vs Feb.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> YUGOSLAV RETAIL SALES	MAR 97	 FEB 97	 MAR 96</p>
<p> pct change mth/mth	  + 16.0	 +  1.0	 +  8.0</p>
<p> pct change yr/yr	    + 37.0	 + 26.0	 + 97.0</p>
<p>CUMULATIVE FIGURES (JAN TO MAR)</p>
<p> pct change yr/yr	    + 34.0	 + 30.0	 +116.0</p>
<p>NOTES -- Data exclude private sector. Data cover Federal Republic of Yugoslavia, comprising Serbia and Montenegro.</p>
<p>-- Amra Kevic, Belgrade newsroom +381 11 222 4305</p>
</text>
